  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the iron-teppan vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fajita seasoning and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the red lentils, vegetable broth, tomato paste, and agave nectar, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and continue to simmer for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve the bissara hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
